WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[Introductory chime] Welcome to Module 2: The Future of the Virtual Assistant (VA) Industry.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The Virtual Assistant profession is not shrinking. It is evolving rapidly as global remote work expands.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
[Soft transition tone] Important Distinction: Virtual Assistant can mean an AI software bot like Siri, or a skilled human remote professional.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
While AI automates repetitive scheduling and data entry, human VAs lead in judgment, empathy, and complex problem-solving.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
By combining AI tools with human communication skills, Ethiopian tech talent can compete for global remote careers.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
[Closing chime] Complete this concept and review the Accessible Career Gateway below to share your verifiable ALX certificate with employers.
